          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"video3\" group=\"Images & Videos\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" plugins=\"PlayerVimeo\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" value=\"0\" step=\"1\" condition=\"fullWidth==false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" value=\"0\" step=\"1\" condition=\"fullWidth==false\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Description\" name=\"showDescription\" checked>\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background1.jpg\" title=\"Image\">\n            <input type=\"color\" value=\"#ffffff\" title=\"Color\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\" title=\"Video\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background13.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.4\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\" opacity=\"{{overlayOpacity}}\" bg-color=\"{{overlayColor}}\"></div>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"mbr-section-head\" mbr-if=\"showTitle || showSubtitle\">\n            <h4 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-0\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\"><b>With Chulalongkorn</b></h4>\n            <h5 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-0 mt-2\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\"></h5>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"row mt-4\">\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-md-6 video-block\">\n                <div mbr-video class=\"video-wrapper\">\n                    <iframe src=\"https://youtu.be/p2PTMAEcXxE\"></iframe>\n                </div>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text pt-2 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showDescription\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\">สรุปโครงการการขยายผลและส่งเสริมแนวทางปฏิบัติที่ดีของการจัดการวัสดุเกษตร<br>และการใช้นวัตกรรมจุลินทรีย์ย่อยตอซังข้าวและข้าวโพดในพื้นที่จังหวัดน่าน<br>Position : Producer , Production manager<br></p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-md-6 video-block\">\n                <div mbr-video class=\"video-wrapper\">\n                    <iframe src=\"https://vimeo.com/1009743879?share=copy\"></iframe>\n                </div>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text pt-2 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showDescription\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\">RSP - Long Journey<br>Position : Producer<br></p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
